{
    "title": "Dual App - Web Scanner App",
    "description": "Dual App - Web Scanner App allows you to open the same account on different devices or log into two WA accounts on a single device. Dual App for WA offers strong connection and <b>avoids unexpected logouts</b>.\r\n\r\nThis free Dual App - Web Scanner App <b>automatically syncs all messages</b> of the cloned WA account which enables you easily read and reply anytime. All downloaded files from cloned WA accounts can also be managed effectively. \r\n\r\nIt\u2019s also a Status Saver that helps you download and repost WA status. And a practical message recovery app that supports restoring deleted WA messages.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhy choose Dual App?\r\n\u2728Fast, Simple & Easy to use Web Scanner App\r\n\u2728Clone WA accounts & Dual WA\r\n\u2728Automatically sync all WA messages\r\n\u2728One-click to recover deleted WA messages\r\n\u2728Free Status Saver & Downloader; share and repost status\r\n\u2728Download, read, and reply all WA messages\r\n\u2728Efficiently manage downloaded files of cloned account\r\n\u2728Lightweight\r\n\u2728Dark Mode\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc65<b>Dual App for WA</b>\r\nYou can <b>clone WA accounts</b> on another device or Dual WA on a single device with this powerful Web Scanner App. Easily read all messages of the cloned account on your device.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f<b>Fast and Stable Connection</b>\r\nScan the QR code in Dual App and you can easily log in to the account. It works smoothly after logging in, no need to worry about unexpected logouts.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc8c<b>Instantly Sync WA Messages</b>\r\nYou can read, reply and download all messages of cloned accounts in real time. Never miss a message.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcdd<b>Recover Deleted Messages</b>\r\nYou can view deleted WA messages in our app. Easily recover all deleted text messages and media files.\r\n\r\n\u23ec<b>Status Saver</b>\r\nStatus Saver helps you easily download all images, GIFs and videos from WA status. You can also share these status with your friends or repost them to other media.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf1<b>Direct Chat</b>\r\nWant to send a message but find out he's not in your contacts? With Direct Chat, you can directly send messages on WA or WA Business without adding contacts.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc1<b>Easily Manage Saved Files</b>\r\nAll downloaded files are well organized in Saved Files. You can centrally manage, view or share your downloaded images, videos or documents at any time.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc82<b>Am I Being Watched?</b>\r\nNo need to worry about your account being watched by others. This Web Scanner App can help you check if your WA account is being logged in by someone else. Try Dual App and keep your account safe!\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcdd<b>How to use Dual App</b>\r\nStep 1: Open the WA account you want to log into\r\nStep 2: Tap Three Dots (Android or Windows) / Settings (iOS), then tap Linked Devices\r\nStep 3: Tap Link A Device to scan the QR code in Dual App to log in\r\nStep 4: Now you can view all messages of the cloned account\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you are looking for a Web Scanner App, Dual App is your best option! It's a powerful Web Scanner App that helps you clone and Dual WA accounts. Try it now!\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\n- Dual App is an independent application and is not affiliated, associated, authorized, endorsed by, or in any way officially connected with the official WhatsApp application or WhatsApp Inc.\r\n- Dual App operates as a standalone application and its features and services are distinct from those offered by WhatsApp.\r\n- Dual App strictly abides by the data privacy protection policy and will never collect your personal information for any purpose.",
